  "label": "The walls of Vatican City",
  "description": "The meme references the high walls of Vatican City (stated as 40 feet high) to contrast with the political wall-building. This requires background knowledge that Vatican City is an independent city-state surrounded by walls for security and historical reasons, not for political or immigration control. The meme uses this to imply a false equivalence between spiritual and political walls.",
